[gd_scene load_steps=16 format=3 uid="uid://cb6hitburst0a6"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://effects/hit_burst.gd" id="0_lifecycle"]

; Effect A, the grit burst. CHANGE-BRIEF.md section 1.3 holds every number
; below and godot/tests/test_hit_burst_config.gd reads every one of them back.
;
; Three emitters under one root, each with its own job: Flash owns frame one,
; Grit owns the shape, Dust owns the tail. All three are one_shot; the burst
; is spawned as its own instance per event and frees itself.
;
; Property names: initial_velocity_min/_max, scale_min/_max, damping_min/_max.
; NOT initial_velocity, scale or damping -- CHANGE-BRIEF.md section 0.2
; measured that those exist on this build as Vector2 properties with usage 12
; that are never written to a scene file, so writing one here would be
; accepted and silently discarded.

